WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.575 --> 00:00:02.596
- Alright, here we are in the future.

00:00:02.596 --> 00:00:04.535
I'm Keith, the Electric Daredevil,

00:00:04.535 --> 00:00:06.902
ready to try the hourglass.

00:00:06.902 --> 00:00:11.902
(lively music)

00:00:12.057 --> 00:00:13.758
- Okay, alright, alright, alright.

00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:15.059
Whoa!

00:00:15.876 --> 00:00:17.161
Oh, no.

00:00:19.232 --> 00:00:20.457
(screaming)

00:00:21.237 --> 00:00:22.583
- And then over here.

00:00:23.493 --> 00:00:24.207
Nope.

00:00:25.353 --> 00:00:26.745
Okay, yup.

00:00:27.777 --> 00:00:28.361
Nope.

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:30.712
- Now what am I supposed to
do with this, go forward?

00:00:32.262 --> 00:00:34.206
(laughing)

00:00:34.838 --> 00:00:37.806
Welcome to the future,
it's very terrifying.

00:00:38.798 --> 00:00:39.674
Whoa!

00:00:40.584 --> 00:00:41.486
- [Voiceover] I can't go forward.

00:00:43.303 --> 00:00:44.156
I'm stuck.

00:00:44.719 --> 00:00:46.013
- [Voiceover] Oh, well I'm spinning.

00:00:46.644 --> 00:00:48.753
If the goal is to spin,
I figured that one out.

00:00:49.385 --> 00:00:51.655
- Alright, gotta do this.

00:00:53.159 --> 00:00:54.175
That actually is working.

00:00:55.457 --> 00:00:56.611
- [Voiceover] Is this supposed to go fast?

00:00:57.497 --> 00:01:02.226
One small step for man, one
giant step for Ashley kind.

00:01:03.405 --> 00:01:06.888
- I feel like, to really go
forward the way I want to,

00:01:06.888 --> 00:01:08.368
I just have to look solemn.

00:01:11.597 --> 00:01:13.447
- [Voiceover] Yeah, I know
you're mad, I'm mad too.

00:01:14.277 --> 00:01:16.785
(laughing)
(screaming)

00:01:16.785 --> 00:01:17.870
- Stop, stop!

00:01:18.642 --> 00:01:19.833
- [Voiceover] I'm so sad.

00:01:21.383 --> 00:01:23.936
Just the saddest man on this tiny,

00:01:23.936 --> 00:01:25.694
portable, lateral skateboard.

00:01:26.421 --> 00:01:27.507
- Yeah, I got this now.

00:01:29.324 --> 00:01:30.513
I feel pretty confident on it.

00:01:31.563 --> 00:01:32.621
I don't like the uneven terrain...

00:01:32.621 --> 00:01:33.869
Oh no, can't slow down.

00:01:34.396 --> 00:01:35.354
- No way, hold on.

00:01:36.439 --> 00:01:37.433
I can't get out of...

00:01:38.344 --> 00:01:39.348
What's happening?

00:01:40.480 --> 00:01:41.896
- I used to live in New York,

00:01:41.896 --> 00:01:45.739
and walking fucking sucked,
if I had one of these,

00:01:45.739 --> 00:01:48.790
dang you give me those 20
blocks and I will board.

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:50.389
Oh, I'm turning, I'm turning, I'm turning.

00:01:52.501 --> 00:01:54.822
- I feel good, I feel proud
of myself that I was able

00:01:54.822 --> 00:01:57.202
to make it to the gate and
back without falling off.

00:01:57.202 --> 00:01:59.837
It probably took me a lot
longer than other people,

00:01:59.837 --> 00:02:01.242
but hey I did it.

00:02:01.242 --> 00:02:04.562
I also feel really old.

00:02:04.562 --> 00:02:06.466
- For me, the positive is
when you have one of these

00:02:06.466 --> 00:02:07.883
everybody knows you got money.

00:02:07.883 --> 00:02:10.451
- It's like I was trying to
hold on to a tree with my legs

00:02:10.451 --> 00:02:13.362
the whole time, except the
tree was moving around.

00:02:13.854 --> 00:02:15.132
- So, I feel really cool.

00:02:15.132 --> 00:02:18.267
I feel a little bit
connected to today's youth.

00:02:18.267 --> 00:02:20.706
Hello youths, I feel connected to you.

00:02:20.706 --> 00:02:21.947
Maybe next time you guys will invite me

00:02:21.947 --> 00:02:24.570
to sit with you at lunch, or not.

00:02:24.570 --> 00:02:25.738
Cool.

00:02:26.451 --> 00:02:28.199
- They're gonna have to
make new laws about this.

00:02:30.375 --> 00:02:31.484
Can I play with it a little more?

00:02:32.546 --> 00:02:33.417
This is cool!

00:02:33.417 --> 00:02:35.048
I also like being the best at it.

00:02:36.818 --> 00:02:37.870
Does it go up hills?

